    "🐍 Image Feed Max Images": "🐍 影像串流最大數量",
    "Limits the number of images in the feed to a maximum, removing the oldest images as new ones are added.": "限制影像串流的影像數量，超過上限時會在新影像加入時移除最舊的影像。",
    "🐍 Image Feed Deduplication": "🐍 移除重複的影像",
    "Ensures unique images in the image feed but at the cost of CPU-bound performance impact (from hundreds of milliseconds to seconds per image, depending on byte size). For workflows that produce duplicate images, turning this setting on may yield overall client-side performance improvements by reducing the number of images in the feed.\n\nRecommended: \"enabled (max performance)\" uness images are erroneously deduplicated.": "確保影像串流中的影像沒有重複，但會犧牲 CPU 效能（依影像大小，每張影像的影響時間從數百毫秒到數秒不等）。對於會產生重複影像的工作流程，開啟此設定可能會透過減少影像數量來提升用戶端的整體效能。\n\n建議：啟用（最高效能），除非影像被錯誤地去重。",
